      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُهْدَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Force; constraint; compulsion.</i> (L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ ضُهْدَةٌ لِكُلِّ أَحَدٍ</span> means <i>He is one who may be
overpowered, subdued,</i> or <i>oppressed, by every one
who desires to make him so.</i> (S, L, K.)

